description:
Work directly with Teamleader and other POs to develop product roadmap in detail, including feature list, feature requirements, and wire-framing the UI following product roadmap;
Manage & execute product development plan to ensure adherence to budget, schedule, and scope;
Conduct analysis of business and user needs to develop requirement documents, and wireframes for the implementation or revision of systems and applications projects;
Maintain the updates of the documents, and wireframes developed during the requirement collection, analysis, and system/application design;
Research and analyze user behaviors from data analytics reports to improve products;
Keep updated with new technologies for the product, UI/UX trends to improve user experience;
Work in conjunction with the development team/QC team, responsible for the product qualification.
Balancing new feature development and bug fixing to ensure regularly scheduled releases are delivered with quality and on time.
Use obtained knowledge during the requirement analysis and systems/applications implementation to make user guides and deliver user training.
Keeping stakeholders informed of documents, relevant development progress, and timeline

